  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금성출판사 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">218</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">쪽에 다음과 같은 탐구가 나옵니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">[</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수산화나트륨 수용액을 적신 실을 붉은색 리트머스 종이 위에 올려놓은 다음 전압을 걸어주면 푸른색이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(+)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">극 쪽으로 펴져나간다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.] </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/237193455954392E2D\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"567\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"567\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"교과서 실험.jpg\"  id=\"A_237193455954392E2DDDEB\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실을 반듯하여 놓을 수 있도록 세로로 선을 그리고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">리트머스 시험지를 두는 자리에는 가로선을 그었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런 다음 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">A4</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지를 코팅하여 나누어 주었습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런데</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">… </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">집게전선으로 고정시키면 리트머스 시험지가 공중부양</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(?)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하여 불편하다고 했어요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">코팅지 폭을 줄이면 편리할 거라는 한 아이의 제안을 받아들여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">세로선의 양쪽 폭을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">센티로 하여 다시 코팅하였더니</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">더 이상 문제가 발생하지 않았습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">리트머스 시험지의 양쪽 끝 부분을 코팅지 아래로 살짝 접어서 집게전선을 연결하도록 했고요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실험결과도 비교적 잘 나왔습니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사진에서 빨간색 집게전선이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(+)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">극 쪽입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2547FE405954398030\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"561\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"561\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"염기성2.jpg\"  id=\"A_2547FE405954398030A903\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]--></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-p